			"Message": "style(Rest): Remove redundant non_snake_case allowance\n\nEliminate the `#![allow(non_snake_case)]` lint suppression from both Binary.rs and Main.rs. The Rust codebase adheres to strict PascalCase naming conventions, and recent cleanups have resolved the identifier cases that previously necessitated this exception.\n\nThis change restores strict linting compliance for the entry points of the Rest bundler.\n\nRefs submodule update: Documentation/Rust (18ee470 -> 2346974)",
